A server script with more than 12 local procedures
(ssl.diagnostics.maxScriptProcedures, default 12) reports
diag.script_size_review once, info tier, on line 1, even though its 39
code lines are far under the 400-line trigger (issue #344).
-- input.ssl --
/* Thirteen small steps;
:PROCEDURE Step01;
	:RETURN 1;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step02;
	:RETURN 2;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step03;
	:RETURN 3;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step04;
	:RETURN 4;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step05;
	:RETURN 5;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step06;
	:RETURN 6;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step07;
	:RETURN 7;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step08;
	:RETURN 8;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step09;
	:RETURN 9;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step10;
	:RETURN 10;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step11;
	:RETURN 11;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step12;
	:RETURN 12;
:ENDPROC;

:PROCEDURE Step13;
	:RETURN 13;
:ENDPROC;
